      "text": "Choose Betalbatim / Colva in South Goa, with all 12 people in one property to simplify meetings and transfers. First property to request a group quote from: Nanu Beach Resort & Spa, Betalbatim. Its official website describes a beachfront, cottage-style resort and meeting/conference halls. This makes it a candidate, not a confirmed budget fit or a guarantee of quietness."
