      "text": "Quiet-room arrangement: reserve at least one room away from road traffic, bars, pool speakers, lifts and wedding/function spaces; ask about events on all three nights and obtain the allocation in writing. Keep loud team activities away from sleeping rooms. A garden-facing room is not necessarily quiet. If single occupancy is desired, re-cost the room mix first; it is not included in this twin-share budget."
