      "startIndex": 5991,
      "endIndex": 6057,
      "text": "18:30–20:00: group dinner; vegetarian mains, not just side dishes."
    },
    {
      "startIndex": 6595,
      "endIndex": 6690,
      "text": "18:30–20:00: closing dinner, team appreciation and a relaxed celebration away from quiet rooms."
    },
    {
      "startIndex": 7198,
      "endIndex": 7301,
      "text": "Evening: fly to Mumbai. Send the action summary after travel, with a follow-up meeting two weeks later."
    },
    {
      "startIndex": 7303,
      "endIndex": 7344,
      "text": "DIETARY, QUIET-ROOM & INCLUSION CHECKLIST"
    },
    {
      "startIndex": 7345,
      "endIndex": 7692,
      "text": "Offer a substantive vegetarian dish at each meal and label vegetarian/non-vegetarian food clearly. Ask whether shared utensils, stock or cooking surfaces are used; arrange separate preparation if required. Confirm other dietary/allergy requirements privately with participants before ordering; do not assume vegetarian means vegan or allergy-safe."
    },
