      "startIndex": 7693,
      "endIndex": 8062,
      "text": "Privately assign the quiet room based on the requester's preference; do not publish a named rooming list in this shared itinerary. Verify hotel event noise for the actual dates. Make nightlife, alcohol, strenuous activities and swimming optional. Provide rest breaks and an indoor alternative. Confirm mobility/accessibility requirements privately rather than guessing."
